{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1778979160894,"sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","part":{"id":"prt_e336bc33c001j0aB4yg6swVlsr","messageID":"msg_e336bc2e9001K7OhpPBjuj695O","sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","snapshot":"62cd9968dabe673b6c78fc2dea1c6309202b8205","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1778979175473,"sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","part":{"id":"prt_e336beb12001E4MKC2XwvlGCXp","messageID":"msg_e336bc2e9001K7OhpPBjuj695O","sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","type":"text","text":"The issue requires one real ontology addition, not just documentation: there is no existing `cuboidal epithelial cell` term, only `columnar/cuboidal epithelial cell`. I’m checking current new-term conventions and nearby modeled epithelial terms so I can add the new class and propagate the morphology axioms consistently.","time":{"start":1778979171090,"end":1778979175467}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778979175497,"sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"call_2elePzjJnTwR8tAv1juwWpC3","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"CL_99[0-9]{5}|terms:date|terms:creator|IAO_0000233","path":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology","include":"cl-edit.owl"},"output":"Found 480 matches (showing first 100)\n/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/src/ontology/cl-edit.owl:\n  Line 3569: Declaration(AnnotationProperty(terms:creator))\n\n  Line 3570: Declaration(AnnotationProperty(terms:date))\n\n  Line 3608: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date cl:blood_and_immune_upper_slim \"2023-03-31T09:17:34Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n\n  Line 3627: AnnotationAssertion(terms:date cl:kidney_upper_slim \"2023-11-22T11:18:57Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n\n  Line 3724: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 cl:has_high_plasma_membrane_amount <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1481>)\n\n  Line 3732: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 cl:has_low_plasma_membrane_amount <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1481>)\n\n  Line 3786: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000003 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2124>)\n\n  Line 4309: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000054 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2698>)\n\n  Line 4318: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000055 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2922\")\n\n  Line 4507: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000073 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1149>)\n\n  Line 4608: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000085 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1935>)\n\n  Line 4616: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000086 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1935>)\n\n  Line 4624: AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000087 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/i