Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&oldid=1226538535 \"Permanent link to this revision of this page\")\n-   [Page information](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=info \"More information about this page\")\n-   [Cite this page](/w/index.php?title=Special:CiteThisPage&page=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&id=1226538535&wpFormIdentifier=titleform \"Information on how to cite this page\")\n-   [Get shortened URL](/w/index.php?title=Special:UrlShortener&url=https%3A%2F%2Fen.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FSimple_cuboidal_epithelium)\n\nPrint/export\n\n-   [Download as PDF](/w/index.php?title=Special:DownloadAsPdf&page=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=show-download-screen \"Download this page as a PDF file\")\n-   [Printable version](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&printable=yes \"Printable version of this page [p]\")\n\nIn other projects\n\n-   [Wikimedia Commons](https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Simple_cuboidal_epithelium)\n-   [Wikidata item](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntityPage/Q3267455 \"Structured data on this page hosted by Wikidata [g]\")\n\nAppearance\n\nmove to sidebar hide\n\nFrom Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia\n\nTissue type\n\nSimple cuboidal epithelium\n\n[![](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Gray1133.png/330px-Gray1133.png)](/wiki/File:Gray1133.png)\n\nSimple cuboidal epithelium in the [pig](/wiki/Pig \"Pig\") [kidney](/wiki/Kidney \"Kidney\"). The surfaces of the large and small [collecting ducts](/wiki/Collecting_duct \"Collecting duct\") (a and b), the circular structures, are surrounded by the simple cuboidal epithelium.\n\nIdentifiers\n\n[TH](/wiki/Terminologia_Histologica \"Terminologia Histologica\")\n\n[H2.00.02.0.02019](https://ifaa.unifr.ch/Public/EntryPage/PDF/TH%20Chapter%20H2.00.pdf)\n\n[FMA](/wiki/Foundational_Model_of_Anatomy \"Foundational Model of Anatomy\")\n\n[45566](https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FMA/?p=classes&conceptid=http%3A%2F%2Fpurl.org%2Fsig%2Font%2Ffma%2Ffma45566)\n\n[Anatomical terminology](/wiki/Anatomical_terminology \"Anatomical terminology\")\n\n\\[[edit on Wikidata](https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3267455 \"d:Q3267455\")\\]\n\nThis article is part of a series on\n\n[Epithelia](/wiki/Epithelium \"Epithelium\")\n\n[Squamous epithelial cell](/wiki/Squamous_epithelial_cell \"Squamous epithelial cell\")\n\n-   [Simple](/wiki/Simple_squamous_epithelium \"Simple squamous epithelium\")\n-   [Stratified](/wiki/Stratified_squamous_epithelium \"Stratified squamous epithelium\")\n\n[Columnar epithelial cell](/wiki/Columnar_epithelial_cell \"Columnar epithelial cell\")\n\n-   [Simple](/wiki/Simple_columnar_epithelium \"Simple columnar epithelium\")\n-   [Stratified](/wiki/Stratified_columnar_epithelium \"Stratified columnar epithelium\")\n-   [Pseudostratified](/wiki/Pseudostratified_columnar_epithelium \"Pseudostratified columnar epithelium\")\n\n[Cuboidal epithelial cell](/wiki/Cuboidal_epithelial_cell \"Cuboidal epithelial cell\")\n\n-   Simple\n-   [Stratified](/wiki/Stratified_cuboidal_epithelium \"Stratified cuboidal epithelium\")\n\nSpecialised epithelia\n\n-   [Olfactory](/wiki/Olfactory_epithelium \"Olfactory epithelium\")\n-   [Respiratory](/wiki/Respiratory_epithelium \"Respiratory epithelium\")\n-   [Intestinal](/wiki/Intestinal_epithelium \"Intestinal epithelium\")\n-   [Transitional](/wiki/Transitional_epithelium \"Transitional epithelium\")\n-   [Vaginal](/wiki/Vaginal_epithelium \"Vaginal epithelium\")\n-   Germinal\n    -   [female](/wiki/Germinal_epithelium_\\(female\\) \"Germinal epithelium (female)\")\n    -   [male](/wiki/Germinal_epithelium_\\(male\\) \"Germinal epithelium (male)\")\n\nOther\n\n-   [Table of epithelia of human organs](/wiki/Table_of_epithelia_of_human_organs \"Table of epithelia of human organs\")\n\n-   [v](/wiki/Template:Epithelia_series \"Template:Epithelia series\")\n-   [t](/wiki/Template_talk:Epithelia_series \"Template talk:Epithelia series\")\n-   [e](/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:Epithelia_series \"Special:EditPage/Template:Epithelia series\")\n\n**Simple cuboidal epithelium** is a type of [epithelium](/wiki/Epithelium \"Epithelium\") that consists of a single layer of cuboidal (cube-like) cells which have large, spherical and central [nuclei](/wiki/Cell_nucleus \"Cell nucleus\").\n\nSimple cuboidal epithelium is found on the surface of [ovaries](/wiki/Ovaries \"Ovaries\"), the lining of [nephrons](/wiki/Nephron \"Nephron\"), the walls of the [renal tubules](/wiki/Renal_tubule \"Renal tubule\"), parts of the [eye](/wiki/Human_eye \"Human eye\") and [thyroid](/wiki/Thyroid \"Thyroid\"), and in [salivary glands](/wiki/Salivary_gland \"Salivary gland\").[\\[1\\]](#cite_note-1)\n\nOn these surfaces, the cells perform [secretion](/wiki/Secretion \"Secretion\") and [filtration](/wiki/Filtration \"Filtration\").\n\n## Location\n\n\\[[edit](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=edit&section=1 \"Edit section: Location\")\\]\n\nSimple cuboidal cells are also found in renal tubules of [nephrons](/wiki/Nephron \"Nephron\"), glandular ducts, and thyroid follicles. Simple cuboidal cells are found in single rows with their spherical nuclei in the center of the cells and are directly attached to the [basal surface](/wiki/Basal_lamina \"Basal lamina\"). Simple ciliated cuboidal cells are also present in the respiratory bronchioles. Germinal cuboidal epithelial lines the [ovaries](/wiki/Ovary \"Ovary\") and [seminiferous tubules](/wiki/Seminiferous_tubule \"Seminiferous tubule\") of [testes](/wiki/Testicle \"Testicle\"). They undergo [meiosis](/wiki/Meiosis \"Meiosis\") to form [gametes](/wiki/Gamete \"Gamete\").\n\n## Functions\n\n\\[[edit](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=edit&section=2 \"Edit section: Functions\")\\]\n\n[![](//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/Gray1176.png/250px-Gray1176.png)](/wiki/File:Gray1176.png)\n\nSection of the sheep [thyroid gland](/wiki/Thyroid_gland \"Thyroid gland\"), with simple cuboidal epithelium (labelled) surrounding [thyroid follicles](/wiki/Thyroid_follicle \"Thyroid follicle\").\n\nThese cells provide protection and may be active (pumping material in or out of the lumen) or passive, depending on the location and cellular specialization.\n\nSimple cuboidal epithelium commonly differentiates to form the secretory and duct portions of glands. They also constitute the germinal epithelium, which covers the ovary (but does not contribute to ovum production) and the internal walls of the seminiferous tubules in the male testes. These cells offer some protection and function in filtration and secretion.\n\n## References\n\n\\[[edit](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=edit&section=3 \"Edit section: References\")\\]\n\n1.  **[^](#cite_ref-1)** [\"Simple Cuboidal Epithelial Tissue\"](http://bio.rutgers.edu/~gb102/lab_6/601cm-simplecu.html). *Rutgers*. Retrieved December 3, 2020.\n\n## External links\n\n\\[[edit](/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&action=edit&section=4 \"Edit section: External links\")\\]\n\n-   [Histology at KUMC](/wiki/University_of_Kansas \"University of Kansas\") *[epithel-epith03](https://www.kumc.edu/instruction/medicine/anatomy/histoweb/epithel/epith03.htm)* \"Thyroid gland\" (Simple cuboidal)\n\n-   [v](/wiki/Template:Epithelium_and_epithelial_tissue \"Template:Epithelium and epithelial tissue\")\n-   [t](/wiki/Template_talk:Epithelium_and_epithelial_tissue \"Template talk:Epithelium and epithelial tissue\")\n-   [e](/wiki/Special:EditPage/Template:Epithelium_and_epithelial_tissue \"Special:EditPage/Template:Epithelium and epithelial tissue\")\n\n[Epithelial](/wiki/Epithelium \"Epithelium\") tissue\n\nCells\n\n-   [Squamous](/wiki/Squamous_epithelial_cell \"Squamous epithelial cell\")\n-   [Cuboidal](/wiki/Cuboidal_epithelial_cell \"Cuboidal epithelial cell\")\n-   [Columnar](/wiki/Columnar_epithelial_cell \"Columnar epithelial cell\")\n\nTypes\n\nSimple\n\n-   [Simple squamous epithelium](/wiki/Simple_squamous_epithelium \"Simple squamous epithelium\")\n    -   [Endothelium](/wiki/Endothelium \"Endothelium\")\n    -   [Mesothelium](/wiki/Mesothelium \"Mesothelium\")\n\n-   Simple cuboidal epithelium\n\n-   [Simple columnar epithelium](/wiki/Simple_columnar_epithelium \"Simple columnar epithelium\")\n\nStratified\n\n-   [Stratified squamous epithelium](/wiki/Stratified_squamous_epithelium \"Stratified squamous epithelium\")\n\n-   [Stratified cuboidal epithelium](/wiki/Stratified_cuboidal_epithelium \"Stratified cuboidal epithelium\")\n\n-   [Stratified columnar epithelium](/wiki/Stratified_columnar_epithelium \"Stratified columnar epithelium\")\n\nOther\n\n-   [Pseudostratified columnar epithelium](/wiki/Pseudostratified_columnar_epithelium \"Pseudostratified columnar epithelium\")\n    -   [Respiratory epithelium](/wiki/Respiratory_epithelium \"Respiratory epithelium\")\n\n-   [Transitional epithelium](/wiki/Transitional_epithelium \"Transitional epithelium\")\n    -   [Urothelium](/wiki/Urothelium \"Urothelium\")\n\nGlands\n\nTypes\n\nMechanism\n\n-   [Merocrine](/wiki/Merocrine \"Merocrine\")\n    -   [Eccrine](/wiki/Eccrine_sweat_gland \"Eccrine sweat gland\")\n-   [Apocrine](/wiki/Apocrine \"Apocrine\")\n-   [Holocrine](/wiki/Holocrine \"Holocrine\")\n    -   [Sebaceous](/wiki/Sebaceous_gland \"Sebaceous gland\")\n    -   [Meibomian](/wiki/Meibomian_gland \"Meibomian gland\")\n\nShape\n\n-   [Tubular gland](/wiki/Tubular_gland \"Tubular gland\")\n-   [Alveolar gland](/wiki/Alveolar_gland \"Alveolar gland\")\n\nSecretion\n\n-   [Serous glands](/wiki/Serous_gland \"Serous gland\")\n-   [Mucous glands](/wiki/Mucous_gland \"Mucous gland\")\n\nComponents\n\n-   [Myoepithelial cell](/wiki/Myoepithelial_cell \"Myoepithelial cell\")\n-   [Serous demilune](/wiki/Serous_demilune \"Serous demilune\")\n\n-   [Ducts](/wiki/Duct_\\(anatomy\\) \"Duct (anatomy)\")\n    -   [Intralobular](/wiki/Intralobular_duct \"Intralobular duct\")\n    -   [Striated](/wiki/Striated_duct \"Striated duct\")\n    -   [Intercalated](/wiki/Intercalated_duct \"Intercalated duct\")\n-   [Acinus](/wiki/Acinus \"Acinus\")/[Lobe](/wiki/Lobe_\\(anatomy\\) \"Lobe (anatomy)\")\n\n![](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:CentralAutoLogin/start?useformat=desktop&type=1x1&usesul3=1)\n\nRetrieved from \"[https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Simple\\_cuboidal\\_epithelium&oldid=1226538535](https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Simple_cuboidal_epithelium&oldid=1226538535)\"\n\n[Category](/wiki/Help:Category \"Help:Category\"):\n\n-   [Epithelial cells](/wiki/Category:Epithelial_cells \"Category:Epithelial cells\")\n\nHidden categories:\n\n-   [Articles with short description](/wiki/Category:Articles_with_short_description \"Category:Articles with short description\")\n-   [Short description matches Wikidata](/wiki/Category:Short_description_matches_Wikidata \"Category:Short description matches Wikidata\")\n\n-   This page was last edited on 31 May 2024, at 08:24 (UTC).\n-   Text is available under the [Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License](/wiki/Wikipedia:Text_of_the_Creative_Commons_Attribution-ShareAlike_4.0_International_License \"Wikipedia:Text of the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License\"); additional terms may apply. By using this site, you agree to the [Terms of Use](https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Terms_of_Use \"foundation:Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Terms of Use\") and [Privacy Policy](https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Privacy_policy \"foundation:Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Privacy policy\"). Wikipedia® is a registered trademark of the [Wikimedia Foundation, Inc.](https://wikimediafoundation.org/), a non-profit organization.\n\n-   [Privacy policy](https://foundation.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:MyLanguage/Policy:Privacy_policy)\n-   [About Wikipedia](/wiki/Wikipedia:About)\n-   [Disclaimers](/wiki/Wikipedia:General_disclaimer)\n-   [Con