Xref \"PMID:30415995\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"Wikipedia:Merkel_cell\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000242 \"A specialized epithelial cell located in the skin epidermis and certain mucosal epithelia. It functions as a mechanoreceptor for light touch by forming synapse-like contacts with somatosensory afferent nerve endings, contributing to slowly adapting type I (SAI) tactile responses. Characterized by dense-core neuroendocrine granules, the Merkel cell exhibits both sensory and neuroendocrine properties, including regulated neurotransmitter release via SNARE complex-dependent mechanisms. Its development in mice depends on the transcription factor Atoh1.\")","truncated":true,"loaded":[]},"title":"src/ontology/cl-edit.owl","time":{"start":1778979357591,"end":1778979357850}},"id":"prt_e336ec386001p3046GzmUvF6Ti","sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","messageID":"msg_e336ea910001CpoLHDtZCWAs52"}}
