nary alveolar type 1 cell. This cuboidal cell is thicker than squamous alveolar cells, has a rounded apical surface that projects above the level of the surrounding epithelium, and its free surface is covered by short microvilli.\")\n14652: AnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_0002063 <https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228>)\n14653: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:creation_date obo:CL_0002063 \"2010-06-24T12:04:13Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\n14654: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0002063 \"BTO:0000538\")\n14655: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0002063 \"FMA:62501\")\n14656: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002063 \"cuboidal type II cell\")\n14657: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002063 \"granular pneumocyte\")\n14658: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002063 \"great alveolar cell\")\n14659: AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002063 \"lung type 2 cell\")\n\n(Showing lines 14640-14659 of 35602. Use offset=14660 to continue.)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002062 \"type I alveolar cells\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002062 \"type I alveolar epithelial cells\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_0002062 \"type I pneumocyte\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:29463737\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0002062 \"AT1\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_0002062 \"ATI\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0002062 \"pulmonary alveolar type 1 cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0002062 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000322 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0007585)))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0002062 obo:CL_0000076)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_0002063 (pulmonary alveolar type 2 cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDb