{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778979518089,"sessionID":"ses_1cc94d5f8ffeT7HuRxhCKpOV7c","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_TYdPYBE3GzP1NkfEFGw3uD3r","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented locally and committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Summary:\n+- added a new `cuboidal epithelial cell` term (`CL_9900001`)\n+- formalized squamous and cuboidal epithelial morphology patterns using `has characteristic`\n+- updated the relations guide and pattern documentation to describe the shape-based modeling approach\n+\n+Validation note:\n+- attempted a ROBOT parse check; it reported a pre-existing ontology structure error unrelated to these edits\n*** Add File: PR_COMMENTS.md\n+Implemented issue #3536 by adding explicit design patterns for squamous and cuboidal epithelial cells and aligning the ontology axioms and documentation with those patterns.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added new term `CL_9900001` `cuboidal epithelial cell` with a textual definition, issue tracker annotation, creator, date, and logical definition:\n+  `epithelial cell and ('has characteristic' some cuboidal)`\n+- Updated `squamous epithelial cell` to use a logical definition:\n+  `epithelial cell and ('has characteristic' some flattened)`\n+- Updated `stratified squamous epithelial cell` to include the flattened morphology differentium in its equivalence axiom.\n+- Reparented `stratified cuboidal epithelial cell` under the new `cuboidal epithelial cell` term.\n+- Added an explicit `has characteristic some flattened` axiom to `pulmonary alveolar type 1 cell`, which is a named squamous epithelial subtype.\n+- Added new DOSDP pattern files:\n+  - `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/squamousEpithelialCell.yaml`\n+  - `src/patterns/dosdp-patterns/cuboidalEpithelialCell.yaml`\n+- Added matching pattern documentation pages under `docs/patterns/`.\n+- Extended `docs/relations_guide.md` with a new cell-shape section showing how to model flattened and cuboidal epithelial morphologies using `RO:0000053` (`has characteristic`).\n+- Updated `docs/patterns/overview.md` to include the two new epithelial shape patterns.\n+\n+Rationale:\n+- The issue asked for explicit design patterns around squamous and cuboidal epithelial cells and for cell characteristics guidance to document this modeling approach.\n+- The ontology already had `columnar/cuboidal epithelial cell`, but not a dedicated `cuboidal epithelial cell` class, so a new term was required to support the requested cuboidal pattern cleanly.\n+- I kept the ontology edit minimal and limited explicit morphology propagation to the directly relevant epithelial classes changed by the new pattern work, rather than trying to normalize every possible free-text mention of squamous/cuboidal morphology across the ontology in one pass.\n+\n+Checklist completed:\n+- [x] Read imported issue context\n+- [x] Checked existing squamous/cuboidal epithelial terms in `src/ontology/cl-edit.owl`\n+- [x] Checked current characteristic modeling guidance in `docs/relations_guide.md`\n+- [x] Checked existing DOSDP pattern structure for consistency\n+- [x] Added new cuboidal epithelial term\n+- [x] Added squamous and cuboidal epithelial DOSDP pattern files\n+- [x] Updated ontology axioms to use `has characteristic` for the epithelial shape pattern\n+- [x] Updated user-facing pattern and relations documentation\n+- [x] Committed only the edited ontology/doc/pattern files\n+\n+Validation performed:\n+- Reviewed the final git diff for the intended files.\n+- Ran `robot convert --input src/ontology/cl-edit.owl --output /tmp/opencode/cl-edit.obo` as a lightweight parse check.\n+- ROBOT reported a pre-existing ontology structure error elsewhere in the file (`CL:4072022`, multiple comment tags), not introduced by this change set.\n+\n+Commit:\n+- `ba3d977` `Add squamous and cuboidal epithelial patterns`\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\nA PR_COMMENTS.md","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/ISSUE_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+Implemented locally and committed in PR #<NN>.\n+\n+Summary:\n+- added a new `cuboidal epithelial cell` term (`CL_9900001`)\n+- formalized squamous and cuboidal epithelial morphology patterns using `has characteristic`\n+- updated the relations guide and pattern documentation to describe the shape-based modeling approach\n+\n+Validation note:\n+- attempted a ROBOT parse check; it reported a pre-existing ontology structure error unrelated to these edits\n\nIndex: /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n===================================================================\n--- /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n+++ /__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/PR_COMMENTS.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,40 @@\n+Implemented issue #3536 by adding explicit design patterns for squamous and cuboidal epithelial cells and aligning the ontology axioms and documentation with those patterns.\n+\n+Changes made:\n+- Added new term `CL_9900001` `cuboidal epithelial cell` with a textual definition, issue tracker annotation, creator, date, and logical definition:\n+  `epithelial cell and ('has characteristic' some cuboidal)`\n+- Updated `squamous epithelial cell` to use a logical definition:\n+  `epithelial cell and ('has characteristic' some flattened)`\n+- Updated `stratified squamous epithelial cell` to include the flattened morphology differentium in its equivalence axiom.\n+- Reparented `stratified cuboidal epithelial cell` under the new `cuboidal epithelial cell` term.\n+- Added an explicit `has characteristic some flattened` axiom to `pulmonary alveolar type 1 cell`, which is a named squamous epithelial subtype.\n+- Added new DOSDP pattern fi